- "Show me pending orders"  
- "Get completed orders"  
- "Orders created between Jan 1 and Mar 31"  
- "Orders in Q2 2025"  
- "Give me order details for ORD-110"  
- "Who are our top 5 customers this quarter?"  
- "Show revenue trend for NYU Langone"  
- "Compare Siemens vs Philips vendor performance"  
- "Analyze CT vs Ultrasound revenue"  
- "Summarize overall sales trends this year"  
- "Create tasks for customer IDs CUST-101, CUST-102 for rep 005xx00000123ABC due tomorrow"  
